## Why This Is Asked
Tests practical implementation of privacy safeguards in Azure OpenAI within multi-tenant SaaS, focusing on data leakage prevention, RBAC, and auditable logging.

## Key Concepts
- PII detection and redaction pipelines
- Grounding with Cognitive Search over a versioned KB
- Per-tenant RBAC with Azure AD
- Data Lake auditing
- GDPR/CCPA compliance checks and synthetic-data tests

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo-code: redaction before OpenAI call
async function process(input, tenantId) {
  const pii = detectPII(input);
  const redacted = redact(input, pii);
  const prompt = buildPrompt(redacted, tenantId);
  return await openai.complete(prompt);
}
```

